      "writtenOn": "2024-12-20T21:38:50Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I think we try to avoid using any h2-specific classes in most other parts of Gerrit code. Can we move this `CacheOptions` class up a level in the package heirarchy? I think the options are generic enough that they could apply to other cache implementations, correct?",
      "revId": "f625a8adf4979c20bf2e1e80b5e11df421842f1d",
      "serverId": "173816e5-2b9a-37c3-8a2e-48639d4f1153"
